                    {
                        "form_id": "e7b0d125-c0db-4f9a-9e8d-c4eaaacac3d4",
                        "entry_id": "860d2d1a-968c-372b-b2ab-8be8168ac5ef",
                        "tags": [
                            "accusative",
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "die Monstranzen"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e0cf3704-b942-3867-9625-de875083a7ec",
                        "entry_id": "860d2d1a-968c-372b-b2ab-8be8168ac5ef",
                        "glosses": [
                            "schmuckvoll gestaltetes, reich verziertes (zumeist goldenes) liturgisches Objekt, in welchem in der Mitte hinter einem kleinen Fenster eine geweihte (konsekrierte) Hostie (das Allerheiligste) als der Leib Christi zur Verehrung sichtbar ausgestellt (gezeigt) wird"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Katholizismus"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ec87520-1150-43f3-9aac-bba949deaa4d",
                                "sense_id": "e0cf3704-b942-3867-9625-de875083a7ec",
                                "text": "Unsere Kirche besitzt eine sehr alte und kostbare Monstranz. Sie ist mit vielen Edelsteinen verziert."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c24ecce-dc19-4acf-91df-2ef6163636f5",
                                "sense_id": "e0cf3704-b942-3867-9625-de875083a7ec",
                                "text": "An Fronleichnam wird das Allerheiligste in der Monstranz sichtbar durch die Straßen getragen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5616ac3-8920-4bcf-a0ca-aa556147810a",
                                "sense_id": "e0cf3704-b942-3867-9625-de875083a7ec",
                                "text": "„Weihrauch quillt in die Dämmerung, die Monstranz funkelt, und nach der Andacht treiben sich die jungen Leute noch einige Zeit umher auf den Plätzen mit den Bäumen, wo die Maikäfer summen.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "200d165d-b4b2-4975-85e3-d5e55a8002c3",
                        "source_entry_id": "860d2d1a-968c-372b-b2ab-8be8168ac5ef",
                        "source_sense_id": "e0cf3704-b942-3867-9625-de875083a7ec",
                        "target_lang_word": "monstrance",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "monstrance",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0061e8e2-8e28-325e-a410-523d6c382d6d",
                                        "entry_id": "ce95ce54-702b-3e67-8ab6-41194d9253b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An ornamental, often precious receptacle, either open or with a transparent cover, in which the sacramental bread (consecrated host) is placed for Eucharistic adoration."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "427884a7-1bc3-4376-a718-40999b04a66b",
                                                "sense_id": "0061e8e2-8e28-325e-a410-523d6c382d6d",
                                                "text": "He loved to kneel down on the cold marble pavement and watch the priest, in his stiff flowered dalmatic, slowly and with white hands moving aside the veil of the tabernacle, or raising aloft the jewelled, lantern-shaped monstrance with that pallid wafer that at times, one would fain think, is indeed the \"panis caelestis,\" the bread of angels, or, robed in the garments of the Passion of Christ, breaking the Host into the chalice and smiting his breast for his sins."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb11e5a5-1d05-4353-9082-0e86aaafde1e",
                                                "sense_id": "0061e8e2-8e28-325e-a410-523d6c382d6d",
                                                "text": "Sir Oswald had done pretty well during the war out of his timber, and there had been no death duties to pay for many years, not since the old man had died. But there was no doubt that the shoe was beginning to pinch. He had been obliged to sell that Spanish monstrance in '30, or was it '31?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "10828452-96a0-4935-9f23-f384ee94bfc3",
                        "source_entry_id": "860d2d1a-968c-372b-b2ab-8be8168ac5ef",
                        "source_sense_id": "e0cf3704-b942-3867-9625-de875083a7ec",
                        "target_lang_word": "ostensoir",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ostensoir",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc5ba8eb-8bb1-33cc-8c01-2cdb12c1cd32",
                                        "entry_id": "51f200b7-404f-3b76-b3e4-0e7224e12959",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Objet de culte, en forme de soleil comportant en son centre une custode de verre ou lunule, dans lequel est exposé le Saint-Sacrement pour le salut et les processions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Liturgie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11a6e352-d088-4228-bd1d-c3b3d612a347",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5ba8eb-8bb1-33cc-8c01-2cdb12c1cd32",
                                                "text": "Tu as donné à la paroisse un ostensoir de cinq mille francs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01135e0c-7070-4187-b6cd-c8e4c2a95988",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5ba8eb-8bb1-33cc-8c01-2cdb12c1cd32",
                                                "text": "Ton souvenir en moi luit comme un ostensoir !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c0b8f5c-40a0-4aa5-af54-485281d12263",
                                                "sense_id": "fc5ba8eb-8bb1-33cc-8c01-2cdb12c1cd32",
                                                "text": "M. le Grand Doyen, vêtue d’une chasuble rutilante de rayons et de flammes d’or, porte sous un dais à pompons blancs l’ostensoir éblouissant de gemmes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1a4cc9d4-f084-40f8-804a-084973ade43d",
                        "source_entry_id": "860d2d1a-968c-372b-b2ab-8be8168ac5ef",
                        "source_sense_id": "e0cf3704-b942-3867-9625-de875083a7ec",
                        "target_lang_word": "monstrance",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "monstrance",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f28baf9-d018-3c60-9be9-a0afbe0b2ed3",
                                        "entry_id": "312a9ac2-241c-37a1-964d-8d24d966cbfc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pièce d’orfèvrerie religieuse dans laquelle des reliques ou une hostie sont conservées dans une lunule en verre et exposées."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a78128b-eaed-4808-845a-2d2b216f3acc",
                                                "sense_id": "8f28baf9-d018-3c60-9be9-a0afbe0b2ed3",
                                                "text": "Je regardai mon avocat : il tenait les yeux fixés sur l’ostensoir, sur le verre brillant de la monstrance où luisait l’Hostie, des yeux à lunettes, au-dessus d’un nez de tapir, un visage chevalin, assez niais, mais que la foi parvenait à rendre émouvant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "313dbc1e-a632-4584-9175-91deb6a0de49",
                                                "sense_id": "8f28baf9-d018-3c60-9be9-a0afbe0b2ed3",
                                                "text": "Ce socle et les bras de la croix étaient percés de petites monstrances : à travers un mince verre bombé, on apercevait des parcelles d’os piquées sur un fond de velours rouge fané et munies chacune d’une mince banderole de parchemin indiquant à quel martyr elles avaient appartenu."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05916a15-e4fb-3890-95a1-21d696423ee5",
                                        "entry_id": "312a9ac2-241c-37a1-964d-8d24d966cbfc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Présentation d’objets ; prestation ou performance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "metonymically"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "908c2db4-b260-4551-b402-a2109439f1a5",
                                                "sense_id": "05916a15-e4fb-3890-95a1-21d696423ee5",
                                                "text": "Elle ordonne aussi que le valet, chaque jour, assiste en compagnie de Juvigny à sa cruelle et parfaite monstrance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
